WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:02.302
-The last time you were here
was the day after the election.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:04.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When you didn't
want to talk politics.

00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:05.638 align:start size:94% position:6%
You only wanted the funny.
-I did.

00:00:05.638 --> 00:00:07.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
You were the perfect tonic.
-Yep.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:08.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So it's so nice
to have you back.

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:10.043 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I want to ask,
before we get started,

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.812 align:start size:94% position:6%
on Halloween, you had a scary
moment during your show.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:13.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, gosh.
-You fainted.

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:16.082 size:84% position:42%
-Have you ever fainted?
-I have never fainted.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:18.718
And it happened during the show.
It was on camera.

00:00:18.718 --> 00:00:19.586 line:92%
Did you know what was happening?

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.821 align:start size:94% position:6%
I, having never fainted,
I don't know what's going on?

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.524 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, there was a tune-up,
where I felt it.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, I felt something
was about to happen.

00:00:27.227 --> 00:00:28.261 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And I fell gracefully,

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I was
the Statue of Liberty.

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:32.132 align:start size:94% position:6%
But my -- my --
-Right, it was Halloween.

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:34.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
-My headpiece
stayed on and everything.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:36.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
--Wow!
Yeah, I fell on my tailbone

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:38.738 align:start size:94% position:6%
and rolled onto my back
ever so gently,

00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:40.140 line:92%
and not one black-and-blue mark,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
not one bit of pain
in the morning.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, that's amazing.
-However...

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:45.245 line:92%
And, also, I was also only out

00:00:45.245 --> 00:00:46.746 size:75% position:38%
for three minutes --
or, three seconds,

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
so I was able to come back
and finish the show.

00:00:49.115 --> 00:00:50.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's amazi--
-Yeah.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:51.651 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The incredible thing
about that,

00:00:51.651 --> 00:00:53.553 align:start size:94% position:6%
that you finished the show
after fainting,

00:00:53.553 --> 00:00:54.254 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you have done --

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.523 align:start size:94% position:6%
you just passed
the 1,500-show milestone.

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Incredible.

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:58.458 line:92%
You're in your ninth season.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:00:59.926 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes.

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:04.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And 1,500 --
you have never missed a show.

00:01:04.497 --> 00:01:05.265 line:92%
-I've never missed a show.

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:08.802
I mean,
I've done the show with a cold,

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:11.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
which, I know, don't judge.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.439 line:92%
I won't be doing that any more.

00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:14.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I've done it with a cold,
you know, fainting

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:17.143 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then getting back up
and powering through.

00:01:17.143 --> 00:01:17.977 line:92%
Everybody was worried about me.

00:01:17.977 --> 00:01:19.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
They wanted me to take off
the rest of the week.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:23.516 align:start size:94% position:6%
But you know what?
I found out I'm low on sodium.

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:26.152 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I'm the one
who's shaking like crazy now.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.588
-Oh, good.
-Drinking a lot of electrolytes.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:29.556 line:92%
-That's exciting to find out

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.624 size:84% position:42%
you're low on something
delicious like sodium.

00:01:31.624 --> 00:01:32.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Like sodium.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:35.195 line:92%
And as a result, dehydrated.

00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:36.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Oh, right, of course.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:38.531 size:88% position:44%
When you went into this,
did you think you were

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.667 align:start size:94% position:6%
the kind of person
that could do 1,500 straight?

00:01:40.667 --> 00:01:43.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
Have you been healthy
your whole life?

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
-Yeah.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, not healthy,
but who's gonna pay my bills?

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.842 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go.
-You know what I mean?

00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:52.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So, more driven than healthy.
-Yes, yes, yes.

00:01:52.011 --> 00:01:53.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have been rewarded
for your drive.

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.116
This is very cool.
You come from Asbury Park, yes?

00:01:56.116 --> 00:01:58.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, I grew up --
Well, I was born in Asbury

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:00.320 line:92%
and raised in Ocean township.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.154 line:92%
-And you got a street sign.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
You got Wendy Williams Way
right there.

00:02:02.755 --> 00:02:06.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you go back and visit it?
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.159 --> 00:02:08.661 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I do, I do.

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:10.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
That street, it used
to be called Central Avenue,

00:02:10.897 --> 00:02:12.365 align:start size:94% position:6%
and now it's called
Wendy Williams Way,

00:02:12.365 --> 00:02:15.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
and my home is on the street,
which I love that.

00:02:15.568 --> 00:02:16.302 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Thank you, Asbury Park.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:19.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go back and visit
to clean up to be sure --

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:21.207 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, nobody's littering.
-Oh, wow.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.208 line:92%
-Nobody's doing anything crazy.

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:24.377 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You take it very seriously,
having your own street.

00:02:24.377 --> 00:02:24.978 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, yes, I do.

00:02:24.978 --> 00:02:27.647
And I bring a stepladder,
because a lot of times

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:30.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
people leave, like,
notes in ziplock bags

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.251 size:81% position:41% line:92%
so they don't get wet.

00:02:31.251 --> 00:02:33.353 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And they leave it on the top?
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:35.922 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And so what do they say?
-"How you doin'?"

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:37.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
or "I love you,"
or, you know, "Call me,"

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:38.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
or, you know,
something like that.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:41.194 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow! It's so great,
in the age of social media,

00:02:41.194 --> 00:02:43.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
that people
are still doing signs.

00:02:43.096 --> 00:02:43.663 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.663 --> 00:02:46.199 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, you have
a Twitter account, right?

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Um...
-All right.

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:49.602 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's very --
That's really cool.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.772 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, we do,
but it's for the show.

00:02:52.772 --> 00:02:54.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So I want to ask about
"Ask Wendy."

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.009 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is something
you do on your show.

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
Been doing it a long time.
-Yes.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.946
-And people have been getting
more comfortable over the years.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.282
What was the difference
from what people would ask Wendy

00:03:02.282 --> 00:03:04.784
in the beginning versus what
people would ask Wendy now?

00:03:04.784 --> 00:03:07.020
-Well, in the beginning,
it would be something like,

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:10.056
"Do you think that these frames
are good for my face?"

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:12.192
You know, a woman wearing
glasses or something like that.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-Or, you know,

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:16.196
"I was thinking of dying
my hair, you know, brown,

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:17.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
and what do you think?"
you know?

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:19.766 size:84% position:42%
"Oh, well, you don't
look nice as a blonde."

00:03:19.766 --> 00:03:22.035 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And now, honey...

00:03:22.035 --> 00:03:23.303 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.837 line:92%
I get asked about threesomes.

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:26.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-Oh, yes.

00:03:26.306 --> 00:03:28.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
I get asked
about affairs with bosses.

00:03:28.775 --> 00:03:31.744 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Really?
-There was a woman who was --

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:34.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
who was a Dean at Harvard
who was on today,

00:03:34.280 --> 00:03:38.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
and so she says to me,
she says, "You know, Wendy,

00:03:38.551 --> 00:03:40.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
there's this woman
in our social circle,

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.021 line:92%
and she kisses my husband.

00:03:42.021 --> 00:03:44.557 align:start size:94% position:6%
She takes his face
and kisses him on the lips

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:46.559
ever so gently,
and she does it all of the time.

00:03:46.559 --> 00:03:50.897
And I notice she doesn't do that
to any other of the other men

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:52.532 size:81% position:41% line:92%
in our social circle."

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:54.567 line:92%
-So what did you tell her to do?

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:58.304
-Tell her, "Milly,
you know that thing that you do

00:03:58.304 --> 00:04:02.875
when you touch my husband's face
and kiss him on the lips?

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:04.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't do it."
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.877 --> 00:04:06.579 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Would you like
some more beans?"

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:07.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, wow.
-Yeah!

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:11.751
-Is it key, then, to make sure
you have beans before you do it?

00:04:11.751 --> 00:04:12.719 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:15.288 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

